          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Adobe Opens New Noida Office With AI Innovation Focus as India Deepens Its Role in Global R&D",
            "articleSection": "Job Evolution",
            "abstract": "Adobe has expanded its India footprint with a new office in Noida, explicitly positioned as a centre for advancing AI-driven innovation and marking what the company calls an important milestone in driving global product development from India. The opening reflects a broader trend of multinational technology firms deepening their India R&D and AI engineering presence as Indian talent pools grow. Adobe has significant India operations and the new facility is expected to support work on AI-powered creative and document tools.",
            "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/sci-tech/technology/adobe-expands-india-footprint-with-new-office-in-noida/article70954378.ece",
